# Otterly social media setup

PH audience (18-40, phone-native, Taglish). Priority order below.

## Bio template (use on every platform)

Handle + display name: @otterly / Otterly

Bio (short, fits all platforms):
```
Otterly: Start, Not Alone.
Calm ADHD task starter for people who freeze on ordinary tasks.
PH-first. iOS.
```

Bio (longer, for platforms that allow it):
```
Otterly is a calm ADHD task starter. Type one task you have been
avoiding. Otterly shrinks it into a step small enough to start,
then sits quietly with you while you do it. One thing, never a
list. No streaks, no badges, no shame. PH-first. iOS launch 2026.
```

Link in bio: https://getotterly.com

